  "body": "For buyers who want the convenience of easy-care living without giving up outdoor space, parking or flexible living, this home offers something refreshingly different.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the end of a row of three homes, this well-maintained two-level property offers approximately 169m² of interior space on a 292m² freehold site, together with an established rear garden, additional side garden and a layout designed for practical everyday living.\r\n\r\nA garden that changes the feel of the home:\r\n• The outdoor setting is one of the property's standout features.\r\n• Carefully established over the years, the rear garden is filled with mature planting and greenery, while the end position provides additional outdoor space along the side of the home.\r\n• Whether for gardening, outdoor dining, children, pets or simply somewhere peaceful to sit, this is outdoor space that can genuinely be used and enjoyed.\r\n\r\nFlexible living across two levels:\r\n• Upstairs are three bedrooms and two full bathrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite.\r\n• Downstairs, a generous family room sits alongside a third full bathroom, creating a genuine fourth-bedroom option for extended family or guests, while working equally well as a second lounge, teenager's retreat, home office or additional family space.\r\n• This separation between the two levels gives the home a level of flexibility that can be difficult to find in more compact properties.\r\n\r\nPractical parking:\r\n• The tandem garage accommodates two vehicles, with an additional off-street parking space in front.\r\n• For households with multiple vehicles, regular visitors or extra storage needs, that flexibility is a genuine everyday advantage.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n• End position in a row of three homes\r\n• Three bedrooms plus flexible ground-floor family room / fourth-bedroom option\r\n• Three full bathrooms, including master ensuite\r\n• Established rear garden and additional side outdoor space\r\n• Tandem garage for two vehicles plus additional off-street parking\r\n• Well-maintained throughout\r\n• Practical two-level layout\r\n\r\nLong Bay Village, local cafés and everyday amenities are within easy reach, while Long Bay Beach, the Regional Park and coastal walks provide the outdoor lifestyle the area is known for.\r\n\r\nLocal schooling and convenient access towards Albany further add to the appeal.\r\n\r\nFor buyers comparing newer or more compact homes, 9 Boardwalk Rise is worth seeing because the space here is not just on paper — it is space you can actually use.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings are also available by appointment.",
